strong>Created:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/destiny/light/guardians\" class=\"entity-link\">Guardians</a>\n            — The Traveler&#039;s Light raises <a href=\"/destiny/light/guardians\" class=\"entity-link\">Guardians</a>.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Sought By:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/destiny/fallen\" class=\"entity-link\">Fallen</a>\n            — The <a href=\"/destiny/fallen\" class=\"entity-link\">Fallen</a> seek the Traveler they lost.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/destiny\" class=\"entity-link\">Destiny</a>\n            — <a href=\"/destiny\" class=\"entity-link\">Destiny</a> is connected to The Traveler through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/destiny/destiny-1\" class=\"entity-link\">Destiny (2014)</a>\n            — <a href=\"/destiny/destiny-1\" class=\"entity-link\">Destiny (2014)</a> is connected to The Traveler through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/destiny/darkness\" class=\"entity-link\">The Darkness</a>\n            — <a href=\"/destiny/darkness\" class=\"entity-link\">The Darkness</a> is connected to The Traveler through shared lore.\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"graph-section\">\n    <h2>Mapped connections</h2>\n\n    <p class=\"section-intro\">\n        Every edge is another route through the subject. Expand a group\n        to see how these threads fit together.\n    </p>\n\n    \n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Connected To</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">3</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"topic-examples\">\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/destiny\"\n                    class=\"connect